于是我们决定，
亲自去度一次房车假期。
So we decided
to go on a caravan holiday.

424
00:19:13,840 --> 00:19:15,320
[观众大笑]
[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

425
00:19:15,360 --> 00:19:17,480
显然，为此
我们需要一辆前车来拖挂，
Now obviously for this,
we needed a towing car,

426
00:19:17,520 --> 00:19:18,920
需要一个露营地。
we needed a campsite.

427
00:19:18,960 --> 00:19:22,280
但最首要的，
我们得先买一辆房车。
But first of all,
we needed to buy a caravan.

428
00:19:27,000 --> 00:19:30,600
克拉克森：就是它了。
瞧瞧，难道不是个大美人吗？
CLARKSON: Here she is.
And isn't she a beauty?

429
00:19:30,640 --> 00:19:34,680
这是一辆 Elddis Shamal XL。
She's an Elddis Shamal XL.

430
00:19:34,720 --> 00:19:38,520
车内铺满了
长绒地毯。
And inside she's got
fitted shag pile carpet.

431
00:19:38,560 --> 00:19:40,480
仿木纹橱柜的厨房。
A woodette kitchen.

432
00:19:40,520 --> 00:19:43,240
立体压花丝绒软包。
Sculpted velour upholstery.

433
00:19:43,280 --> 00:19:45,560
一个卫生间，四张床。
A bathroom. Four beds.

434
00:19:45,600 --> 00:19:48,640
甚至还有一个能让我
把腰板挺得笔直的角落。
And a spot where even
I can stand up properly.

435
00:19:50,960 --> 00:19:52,200
猜猜看，我们花了多少钱
And guess
how much we paid

436
00:19:52,240 --> 00:19:54,960
就搞定了这一切的奢华
与便利。
for all this luxury
and convenience.

437
00:19:55,000 --> 00:19:57,200
错，你猜得大错特错。
Nope, you're quite wrong.

438
00:19:57,240 --> 00:20:00,320
整套拿下一共才花了三千英镑。
We got the lot for £3,000.

439
00:20:00,360 --> 00:20:04,440
至于拖车的座驾，我们选了
一辆非同寻常、
极其特别的狠角色。
Now, for our car we've got
something really very,
very special.

440
00:20:04,480 --> 00:20:08,400
看呐，就是它——
起亚赛拉图（Kia Cerato）
1.5 柴油版。
There she is.
It's the Kia Cerato
1.5 diesel.

441
00:20:12,360 --> 00:20:16,840
梅：我们选了
这辆1.1万英镑的掀背车，
是因为它经济省油。
MAY: We chose
this £11,000 hatchback
because it's economical.

442
00:20:16,880 --> 00:20:22,280
还因为它是房车俱乐部评选的
2006年度
最佳拖挂车。
And because it's the 2006
Caravan Club
tow car of the year.

443
00:20:25,320 --> 00:20:26,720
而且我们这次
And we're not
gonna be staying

444
00:20:26,760 --> 00:20:29,680
也不会去住瓦斯厂旁边
那种破建筑工地。
in some builder's yard
next to a gas works, either.

445
00:20:29,720 --> 00:20:32,160
我们要住的是五星级营地，
We're staying at
a five-star site

446
00:20:32,200 --> 00:20:34,080
坐落在多塞特郡
起伏的丘陵之中。
in the rolling hills
of Dorset.

447
00:20:34,120 --> 00:20:36,560
换句话说，
我们这次完全是
按标准教科书来玩的。
In other words,
we're doing this
by the book.

448
00:20:36,600 --> 00:20:39,040
我们选对了房车，选对了拖车，
We have got the right van,
we've got the right car,

449
00:20:39,080 --> 00:20:40,600
要去最对的营地，
we're going to the right site

450
00:20:40,640 --> 00:20:43,640
要是运气好点，
这好天气还能撑住。
and with a bit of luck
this weather will hold.

451
00:20:43,680 --> 00:20:46,240
倒。倒。
Back. Back.

452
00:20:46,280 --> 00:20:48,480
[大喊] 倒！
倒！倒！
[SHOUTING] Back.
Back. Back!

453
00:20:48,520 --> 00:20:50,360
-倒，倒！
-哎呀，老天爷啊！
-Back, back!
-Oh, for God's sake!

454
00:20:50,400 --> 00:20:51,720
但你刚才喊的就是“倒”。
But you said, "Back."

455
00:20:51,760 --> 00:20:53,600
-别光喊“倒”啊！
-不对，我的意思是“倒”！
-Don't just say, "Back!"
-No, I meant, "Back!"

456
00:20:53,880 --> 00:20:55,160
倒。
Back.

457
00:20:55,200 --> 00:20:56,760
-克拉克森：詹姆斯？
-梅：怎么？
-CLARKSON: James?
-MAY: Yeah?

458
00:20:56,800 --> 00:20:58,600
踩刹车。好。
Do the brakes. Yeah.

459
00:20:58,640 --> 00:21:00,160
还有双闪。
And hazards.

460
00:21:00,200 --> 00:21:03,120
正常车灯。
全亮了。
齐活了。
Normal lights.
Everything's on.
We're in business.

461
00:21:03,360 --> 00:21:06,320
克拉克森：最后，
我们还得装上
加宽后视镜。
CLARKSON: Finally,
we had to attach
the extended door mirrors.

462
00:21:06,360 --> 00:21:09,960
这对全球最火汽车节目的主持人来说，
肯定不在话下吧？
No problem, surely,
for the hosts of
the world's biggest car show?

463
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:12,160
-我跟你一车……
-拿来吧你，
我弄给你看。
-I'll ride with you...
-Just give it here,
I will show you.

464
00:21:12,200 --> 00:21:13,880
我按着，你把带子勒紧。
I'll hold it on.
You tighten the straps up.

465
00:21:13,920 --> 00:21:16,160
克拉克森：装反了。
CLARKSON: Wrong.

466
00:21:16,200 --> 00:21:18,840
-啊！搞定！
-那玩意儿要是能挂住，我输你十镑。
-Ah! Yes!
-I'll give you ten quid
if that stays on.

467
00:21:21,600 --> 00:21:26,160
克拉克森：
不过不管怎样，我们最终还是踏上了
前往多塞特郡的一百英里之旅。
CLARKSON:
Eventually, though, we began
our 100-mile trip to Dorset.

468
00:21:26,200 --> 00:21:30,000
“龟速船长”开着一辆起亚，
后面拖着房车。
Captain Slow at the wheel
of a Kia towing a caravan.

469
00:21:30,040 --> 00:21:33,560
-他心里其实乐开花了。
-没错，就是。
他爽翻了都。
-Secretly, he is delighted.
-Yeah, he is.
He's loving this.

470
00:21:34,680 --> 00:21:36,040
-克拉克森：伙计们。
-怎么。
-CLARKSON: Chaps.
-Yes.

471
00:21:36,080 --> 00:21:39,000
这儿有份必备配件清单。
There's a list
of essential accessories.

472
00:21:39,040 --> 00:21:40,320
行，看咱们带齐没有。
Okay. Let's see
if we've got 'em.

473
00:21:40,360 --> 00:21:42,200
-登车踏板。
-没有。
-Step.
-No.

474
00:21:42,240 --> 00:21:44,200
-储水桶。
-没有。
-Water container.
-No.

475
00:21:44,240 --> 00:21:46,400
-市电连接线。
-没有。
-Mains hook-up lead.
-No.

476
00:21:46,440 --> 00:21:48,000
-房车电瓶。
-没有！
-Leisure battery.
-No!

477
00:21:49,120 --> 00:21:50,880
-煤气罐。
-没有。
-Gas cylinders.
-No.

478
00:21:50,920 --> 00:21:52,640
克拉克森：拖车后视镜。
齐声：有！
CLARKSON: Towing mirrors.
ALL: Yes!

479
00:21:54,080 --> 00:21:55,480
我们都可以去当吉普赛人了。
We could be gypsies.

480
00:22:00,040 --> 00:22:03,240
克拉克森：在确信所有
用得上的东西全落在家之后，
CLARKSON : Having established
that we'd left everything
we'd need at home,

481
00:22:03,280 --> 00:22:06,080
我们转向了
更加熟悉的领域……
we moved on
to more familiar ground...

482
00:22:06,120 --> 00:22:08,520
公路试车。
Road testing cars.

483
00:22:08,560 --> 00:22:11,000
开上开阔大路了，
看看这车到底能跑多快。
We're on the open road.
Let's see what she'll do.

484
00:22:11,040 --> 00:22:13,560
[奏响《复仇者》主题曲]
[THE AVENGERS
THEME TUNE PLAYS]

485
00:22:13,920 --> 00:22:15,360
30迈。
30.

486
00:22:15,400 --> 00:22:17,520
[《复仇者》主题曲继续播放]
[THE AVENGERSTHEME TUNE
CONTINUES]

487
00:22:19,080 --> 00:22:20,920
-才30。
-[大笑]
-30.
-[LAUGHS]

488
00:22:20,960 --> 00:22:22,400
好吧，35了。
Well, 35.

489
00:22:22,440 --> 00:22:24,680
-克拉克森：油门踩到底，詹姆斯。
-已经踩到底了。
-CLARKSON: Foot down, James.
-Foot is down.

490
00:22:24,720 --> 00:22:26,960
-开30迈挺惬意的。
-[轻笑] 30迈挺……
-30's nice.
-[CHUCKLES] 30 is...

491
00:22:27,000 --> 00:22:28,640
你最好趁早习惯
开30迈。
You'd better get used
to doing 30.

492
00:22:31,960 --> 00:22:36,040
克拉克森：没过多久，
我们屁股后头
就排起了一条望不到头的大长龙。
CLARKSON: Pretty soon
an enormous jam
had formed in our wake.

493
00:22:36,080 --> 00:22:39,080
-天呐，见鬼。
-怎么了？
-Oh, strewth.
-What?

494
00:22:39,120 --> 00:22:40,680
-后面压了几百辆车！
-[众人大笑]
-There's hundreds of 'em.
-[ALL LAUGHING]

495
00:22:40,720 --> 00:22:43,480
克拉克森：我知道！
那些开房车的人到底怎么受得了的？
CLARKSON: I know!
How do caravanners do this?

496
00:22:43,520 --> 00:22:47,880
他们怎么能一边开，
一边不觉得“这脸我丢不起”呢？[轻笑]
How do they drive along
thinking, "I can't bear
the shame"? [CHUCKLES]

497
00:22:47,920 --> 00:22:50,280
而且你们知道吗，
要是听过房车俱乐部吹嘘的那套大话，
And do you know,
if you heard the great thing
of Caravan Club,

498
00:22:50,320 --> 00:22:53,520
总说什么“我们的会员
都会靠边停车让后车先过”。
always say, "Our members
always pull over
to let people by."

499
00:22:53,560 --> 00:22:55,760
我都开了快三十年车了，
I've been driving
for nearly 30 years.

500
00:22:55,800 --> 00:22:59,480
打死我也从来、从来
没见过有人让过！
I have never, ever,
seen that happen.

501
00:22:59,520 --> 00:23:03,520
克拉克森：最终，我们实在受不了
这份奇耻大辱，
靠边停车了。
CLARKSON: Eventually, we could
take the shame no more
and pulled over.

502
00:23:03,560 --> 00:23:05,480
瞧，有人心存感激了。
就是这位。
See, who's grateful.
He is.

503
00:23:05,520 --> 00:23:07,280
-不好意思啊。
-对不住。
-Sorry.
-Sorry.

504
00:23:07,320 --> 00:23:08,800
抱歉。
Sorry.

505
00:23:08,840 --> 00:23:10,520
对不起。对不住啊。
Sorry. Sorry.

506
00:23:15,320 --> 00:23:18,320
克拉克森：显而易见，
我们横看竖看都不算房车专家。
CLARKSON: Obviously,
we're not caravan experts
in any way.

507
00:23:18,360 --> 00:23:20,240
但才开了短短一截路，
But after just after
a short distance,

508
00:23:20,280 --> 00:23:22,560
连我们都看得出，这辆起亚
even we were able
to recognise that the Kia

509
00:23:22,600 --> 00:23:25,240
实在算不上一辆合格的
牵引车。
is not an especially good
tow car.

510
00:23:25,280 --> 00:23:28,240
退一步讲，要是必须拖个房车，
那玩意儿有多重来着？
If you accept
you have to tow a caravan
which weighs what?

511
00:23:28,280 --> 00:23:31,840
那玩意儿重1200……
不对，大概1000公斤。
That thing weighs 1,200...
No, about 1,000 kilograms.

512
00:23:31,880 --> 00:23:34,400
-没错。
-你得要最大、
最狂暴的扭矩。
-Yeah.
-You want the most
amount of torque.

513
00:23:34,440 --> 00:23:37,480
克拉克森：于是我们列了一份
更靠谱的候选名单。
CLARKSON: So we made
a more sensible shortlist.

514
00:23:37,520 --> 00:23:40,320
-道奇蝰蛇（Dodge Viper）。
-这才叫正儿八经的牵引车！
-Dodge Viper.
-Now there's a tow car.

515
00:23:40,360 --> 00:23:42,320
-悍马军车（Humvee）。
-对，弄辆悍马简直绝了。
-A Humvee.
-Yeah, a Humvee
would be terrific.

516
00:23:42,360 --> 00:23:43,640
拿它拖栋房子都行。
You could tow a house
with that.

517
00:23:43,680 --> 00:23:46,480
路虎发现（Land Rover Discovery），
自重将近三吨。
A Land Rover Discovery.
Nearly three tonnes.

518
00:23:46,520 --> 00:23:47,960
-是啊。
-庞然大物。
-Yeah.
-Enormous.

519
00:23:48,000 --> 00:23:49,600
-还是台V8。
-没错。
-Even the V8.
-Yeah.

520
00:23:49,640 --> 00:23:51,640
你都能把造那辆房车的工厂给拖走。
You could tow the factory
that caravan was built in.

521
00:23:54,920 --> 00:23:56,320
克拉克森：
把那档子破事摆平后，
CLARKSON:
Having sorted that out,

522
00:23:56,360 --> 00:24:00,240
我们的心思又转回到了
那台沙马尔XL上。
our thoughts turned back
to the Shamal XL.

523
00:24:00,280 --> 00:24:01,680
你根本没进去好好看过吧。
You haven't looked round
it properly.

524
00:24:01,720 --> 00:24:03,000
要我给你念念里头都有啥吗？
You want me
to tell you what's in it?

525
00:24:03,040 --> 00:24:05,440
求之不得，路上正好给我解解闷。
Please. It'll entertain me
on the journey.

526
00:24:05,480 --> 00:24:07,640
克拉克森：压花天鹅绒内饰软包。
CLARKSON: Sculptured velour
upholstery.

527
00:24:07,680 --> 00:24:09,200
那内饰简直绝了。
It is amazing upholstery.

528
00:24:09,240 --> 00:24:10,960
我一钻进去，
立马就馋印度咖喱了。
I went in there
and immediately
wanted a curry.

529
00:24:11,000 --> 00:24:13,760
[众人大笑]
[ALL LAUGHING]

530
00:24:13,800 --> 00:24:16,600
唯一美中不足的是，
里面只有一张双人床。
The only drawback is
there's a double bed.

531
00:24:18,720 --> 00:24:20,600
真的假的？
Is there?

532
00:24:20,640 --> 00:24:23,400
克拉克森：显然我们当中
必须得有一个睡车外头。
CLARKSON: Clearly one of us
would have to sleep outside.

533
00:24:25,040 --> 00:24:27,080
不过我想，
总比跟詹姆斯同床共枕强。
Better than sleeping
with James, I suppose.

534
00:24:29,600 --> 00:24:31,720
所以我们对这次度假毫无期待。
So we weren't looking forward
to our holiday.

535
00:24:31,760 --> 00:24:35,320
而且说实话，
路上这段行程我们也根本享受不起来。
And if I'm honest,
we weren't enjoying
the journey that much either.

536
00:24:35,360 --> 00:24:37,560
我们才开了52英里。
We've done 52 miles.

537
00:24:37,600 --> 00:24:39,160
-就这点儿？
-昂。
-That's it?
-Yep.

538
00:24:39,200 --> 00:24:41,840
我们在路上已经磨蹭了
三个多小时，
We've been on the road now
for three and a quarter hours

539
00:24:41,880 --> 00:24:43,800
你就只挪了52英里？！
and you've done 52 miles?

540
00:24:43,840 --> 00:24:45,880
克拉克森：你刚才摸我手了。
CLARKSON: You held
my hand there.

541
00:24:45,920 --> 00:24:48,600
梅：屁话，是你把爪子
搁在挡把边上……
我还得换挡呢！
MAY: No, you put your hand
next to the gears...
I've got to change gears.

542
00:24:48,640 --> 00:24:50,880
-根本就没这回……
-前排的别吵了！
-There is no way...
-Stop fighting in the front.

543
00:24:50,920 --> 00:24:53,320
哈蒙德：咱们还有
大老远的路要赶呢。
HAMMOND: We've got
a long way to go.

544
00:24:53,360 --> 00:24:55,520
克拉克森：起亚车厢里越来越让人感到幽闭窒息，
CLARKSON: It was getting
claustrophobic in the Kia

545
00:24:55,560 --> 00:24:57,040
但既然我们是在
开拖挂房车自驾游，
but because
we were caravanning,

546
00:24:57,080 --> 00:24:59,480
那就能像其他房车佬一样，
we could do
what caravanners do,

547
00:24:59,520 --> 00:25:01,360
直接把车往路边一停，
pull over
at the side of the road

548
00:25:01,400 --> 00:25:04,320
来一顿美滋滋的午餐。
and have a spot of lunch.

549
00:25:04,360 --> 00:25:06,680
-克拉克森：跟你说啊。
-梅：啥？啊？
-CLARKSON: Tell you what.
-MAY: What? Hey?

550
00:25:06,720 --> 00:25:08,840
克拉克森：这里真清静。
CLARKSON: This is peaceful.

551
00:25:08,880 --> 00:25:11,000
-哈蒙德：来块猪肉派吗？
-克拉克森：什么？
-HAMMOND: Pork pie?
-CLARKSON: What?

552
00:25:11,040 --> 00:25:11,840
哈蒙德：猪肉派要吗？
HAMMOND: Pork pie?

553
00:25:12,960 --> 00:25:14,280
房车同好来了！
Caravanners.

554
00:25:14,320 --> 00:25:15,880
克拉克森：
是一台Overlander GL！
CLARKSON:
It's the Overlander GL!

555
00:25:15,920 --> 00:25:17,400
-耶！
-万岁！
-Yay!
-Hooray!

556
00:25:20,320 --> 00:25:23,560
哈蒙德：午饭后，
杰里米把东西收拾妥当，
我们就出发了。
HAMMOND: After lunch,
Jeremy packed everything away
and we set off.

557
00:25:27,360 --> 00:25:29,720
[餐具稀里哗啦碎了一地]
[CROCKERY CLATTERS]

558
00:25:31,400 --> 00:25:36,120
就在这时，我们领教到了
拖挂房车凶险的那一面。
And it was then we encountered
the dangerous side
of caravanning.

559
00:25:36,160 --> 00:25:39,160
克拉克森：詹姆斯，
这车在左右晃荡画龙呢。
CLARKSON: James.
The car is weaving about.

560
00:25:39,200 --> 00:25:41,000
-不对劲，
这绝不正常。
