接下来，是更让人刺激的内容。
And now for even
more excitement.

837
00:37:25,160 --> 00:37:29,040
因为最近，
我在一座大型会展中心里
泡了一上午。
Because recently,
I spent a morning
at a large exhibition centre.

838
00:37:29,080 --> 00:37:30,440
[观众笑声]
[AUDIENCE LAUGHS]

839
00:37:32,000 --> 00:37:35,440
哈蒙德：这里是伦敦
ExCeL国际会展中心的主展厅。
HAMMOND: This is the main hall
at the Excel Centre in London.

840
00:37:35,480 --> 00:37:38,600
下周，这里就将成为
英国国际车展的举办地。
And next week,
it'll be the venue for
the British Motor Show.

841
00:37:38,640 --> 00:37:44,520
这地方大得离谱，
足足有385米长。
It is a huge space.
Some 385 metres long.

842
00:37:44,560 --> 00:37:46,800
所以，趁各大汽车厂商
还没把这里塞满——
So, before all
the car companies
fill the place

843
00:37:46,840 --> 00:37:49,760
塞满他们的旋转展台
和浑身喷得黄澄澄的车模小姐之前，
with their revolving stands
and Orange promo girls,

844
00:37:49,800 --> 00:37:53,120
我们打算溜进来，
办一场属于我们自己的车展。
we thought we'd sneak in
and hold our own motor show.

845
00:37:53,160 --> 00:37:54,320
不过问题在于，
The thing is, though,

846
00:37:54,360 --> 00:37:57,680
我们只打算展出一辆车。
we'll only be
exhibiting one car.

847
00:37:57,720 --> 00:37:59,680
哈蒙德：
但这一辆就足够炸裂了。
HAMMOND:
But it should be plenty.

848
00:38:00,560 --> 00:38:01,920
就是这台！
This is it!

849
00:38:01,960 --> 00:38:04,240
一辆丰田F1赛车。
A Toyota F1 car.

850
00:38:04,280 --> 00:38:08,480
而且是2005款，
背着台暴躁的大号V10引擎。
And it's the 2005 model
with the big V10 engine.

851
00:38:08,520 --> 00:38:11,680
转速能直逼一万九千转，
It spins to 19,000 rpm

852
00:38:11,720 --> 00:38:15,680
能压榨出整整900匹的
恐怖制动马力。
and produces a colossal
900 brake horsepower.

853
00:38:15,720 --> 00:38:18,840
放在一辆只有半吨重的车上，
这马力简直丧心病狂。
That's a lot in a car
that weighs half a ton.

854
00:38:18,880 --> 00:38:23,880
事实上狂暴到
能让它直接飙上
时速220英里。
In fact, it's such a lot,
that it can do 220 miles
an hour.

855
00:38:25,960 --> 00:38:28,040
有了这么炸裂的性能数据，
Now, with performance
figures like those,

856
00:38:28,080 --> 00:38:30,440
把它供在展台上纯属暴殄天物，
there's no point
in putting it on a plinth,

857
00:38:30,480 --> 00:38:34,200
而且这个展厅又出奇的长。
and this hall is pretty long.

858
00:38:34,240 --> 00:38:37,720
所以，我们要玩一把
从未有人敢干的骚操作。
So, we're going to try
something that's never
been done before.

859
00:38:37,760 --> 00:38:40,760
没错，有史以来头一回，
Yep, for the first time
in the history of anything,

860
00:38:40,800 --> 00:38:43,920
我们要测测看，开着一辆F1赛车
we're going to see how fast
you can run an F1 car

861
00:38:43,960 --> 00:38:46,280
在室内究竟能飙多快。
indoors.

862
00:38:46,320 --> 00:38:49,720
哈蒙德：具体来说，
我们要让它从展厅这头起步，
HAMMOND: Specifically,
we're going to start it
at one end of the hall

863
00:38:49,760 --> 00:38:52,080
看看它到底能冲到多快，
and then see
what speed it can get to,

864
00:38:52,120 --> 00:38:54,560
赶在车手不得不一脚踩死刹车、
before the driver
has to hit the brakes

865
00:38:54,600 --> 00:38:57,480
免得撞穿尽头那堵厚实的墙壁之前。
to avoid the solid wall
at the other end.

866
00:39:00,440 --> 00:39:03,720
正因如此，我们需要一名
不知恐惧为何物的车手，
Which is why we're going
to need a driver
who knows no fear,

867
00:39:03,760 --> 00:39:05,640
而且他没有任何赞助商要顾及——
who has no sponsors
to upset

868
00:39:05,680 --> 00:39:07,680
万一刹车踩晚了，在墙上撞出个大窟窿，
if he hits the brakes
too late and punches a big,

869
00:39:07,720 --> 00:39:10,480
一个F1赛车形状的大窟窿。
Formula-One-car-shaped hole
in the wall.

870
00:39:12,440 --> 00:39:14,400
哈蒙德：没错，斯提格。
HAMMOND: Yes, The Stig.

871
00:39:15,520 --> 00:39:17,640
在彻底点燃这台F1神兽之前，
Before we ignited
the F1 car,

872
00:39:17,680 --> 00:39:21,040
斯提格先拿我们的
“廉价家用车”雪佛兰Lacetti跑了一趟。
Stig did a run in our
reasonably priced
Chevrolet Lacetti.

873
00:39:21,920 --> 00:39:23,480
[轮胎尖叫声]
[TYRES SCREECHING]

874
00:39:23,520 --> 00:39:25,240
好给大家做个直观对比，
This would put things
in perspective

875
00:39:25,280 --> 00:39:28,520
看看一辆日常买菜车
在这儿究竟能开多快。
by showing us what speed
an everyday road car
could manage.

876
00:39:31,040 --> 00:39:34,360
斯提格直接无视了
安全主管举起的大号停车牌，
Stig ignored the health
and safety man's
big stop sign

877
00:39:34,400 --> 00:39:36,200
一路狂飙到了时速70英里。
and managed
70 miles an hour.

878
00:39:36,240 --> 00:39:41,080
对一辆只有118匹马力的
1.8升家用代步车来说，相当不赖了。
Not bad for a 1.8 litre car
with just 118 horsepower.

879
00:39:41,120 --> 00:39:42,880
[刹车尖叫声]
[BRAKES SCREECHING]

880
00:39:47,280 --> 00:39:49,120
不过现在，重头戏登场！
But now for the main event.

881
00:39:49,160 --> 00:39:52,440
这辆丰田的马力
是那辆Lacetti的八倍，
The Toyota has eight times
the power of the Lacetti

882
00:39:52,480 --> 00:39:55,160
而重量却只有它的
三分之一多一点。
and is just over
a third of the weight.

883
00:39:55,200 --> 00:39:57,600
就让我们看看它能跑多快。
So let's see what it can do.

884
00:40:01,320 --> 00:40:02,720
[引擎轰鸣]
[ENGINE ROARS]

885
00:40:21,200 --> 00:40:22,520
[掌声]
[APPLAUSE]

886
00:40:23,400 --> 00:40:24,840
克拉克森：不，等等，先别鼓掌。
CLARKSON: No, no, wait.

887
00:40:28,840 --> 00:40:32,200
好了，刚才那辆
雪佛兰Lacetti立下的
基准成绩
Okay, now,
the Chevy Lacetti
set the benchmark there

888
00:40:32,240 --> 00:40:34,560
是时速70英里，
对吧？
of 70 miles an hour,
all right?

889
00:40:34,600 --> 00:40:37,640
那么，大家觉得
这辆F1赛车跑了多快？
So, how fast do we think
the Formula One car went?

890
00:40:37,680 --> 00:40:39,120
行，有人想猜一下吗？
Okay, anyone want a guess?

891
00:40:39,160 --> 00:40:40,760
- 男观众：170！
- 克拉克森：170。
-MAN: 170.
-CLARKSON: 170.

892
00:40:40,800 --> 00:40:42,000
150。
150.

893
00:40:42,040 --> 00:40:43,160
180。
180.

894
00:40:43,200 --> 00:40:44,680
- 男观众：120！
- 克拉克森：120？
-MAN: 120.
-CLARKSON: 120?

895
00:40:44,720 --> 00:40:47,720
大家的猜测区间
跟我们当时想的大差不差，所以……
You're all in the ball park
we were thinking of, so...

896
00:40:47,760 --> 00:40:51,000
理查德，你来告诉他们，
它到底跑了多快？
Richard, tell them,
how fast did it go?

897
00:40:51,040 --> 00:40:53,320
那个，我觉得
要不还是你来说吧。
You know, I think maybe
you should do that.

898
00:40:53,360 --> 00:40:54,960
不，这可是你的实验。
No, it was your experiment.

899
00:40:55,000 --> 00:40:57,160
由你来告诉大家
它到底跑了多快。
You tell them
how fast it went.

900
00:40:57,200 --> 00:40:58,880
[咕哝，清嗓子]
[MUTTERS, CLEARS THROAT]

901
00:40:58,920 --> 00:41:00,760
- 大点声！
- [小声嘟囔]
-Say it louder.
-[MUTTERING]

902
00:41:00,800 --> 00:41:04,040
- 时速81英里。
- [观众大笑]
-81 miles an hour.
-[AUDIENCE LAUGHS]

903
00:41:04,080 --> 00:41:06,520
克拉克森：真没骗你们。
刚好时速81英里。
CLARKSON: It did.
It was 81 miles an hour.

904
00:41:06,560 --> 00:41:07,760
它最快也就只能跑这样了，
That was as quick
as it would go

905
00:41:07,800 --> 00:41:09,000
因为动力根本传不到地面上。
Because it couldn't
put its power down.

906
00:41:09,040 --> 00:41:10,640
是啊，问题就在于……
Yeah. The thing is...

907
00:41:10,680 --> 00:41:11,440
克拉克森：车轮自始至终都在原地疯狂打滑。
CLARKSON: It just spun
its wheels all of the time.

908
00:41:11,480 --> 00:41:12,840
动力全白瞎了。
All of the power gone.

909
00:41:12,880 --> 00:41:14,640
我们本来打算
把整段片子直接扔进垃圾桶，
And we were going
to throw that whole film away

910
00:41:14,680 --> 00:41:16,040
懒得播出来的。
and not bother showing it.

911
00:41:16,080 --> 00:41:18,000
结果我们突然发现，
And then we discovered

912
00:41:18,040 --> 00:41:23,120
世界上居然压根没有
汽车室内速度纪录这玩意儿。
that there was no indoors
speed record for cars at all.

913
00:41:23,160 --> 00:41:26,560
也就是说，我们以81英里的时速，
创下了世界纪录！
Which means, we've set
the world record
at 81 miles an hour!

914
00:41:26,600 --> 00:41:28,120
- 没错，我们破纪录了。
- 耶！
-Yes, we have.
-Yeah!

915
00:41:28,160 --> 00:41:30,400
- 克拉克森：没错，我们做到了！
- [观众鼓掌]
-CLARKSON: Yes, we have!
-[AUDIENCE APPLAUDING]

916
00:41:30,440 --> 00:41:33,360
真正搞笑的是，
我们差一点点，
纯属瞎猫碰上死耗子，
What's really funny
is that we very
nearly accidentally

917
00:41:33,400 --> 00:41:36,400
靠那辆雪佛兰Lacetti
把这个世界纪录给破了。
set the speed record
in the Chevrolet Lacetti.

918
00:41:37,800 --> 00:41:42,880
在节目开头，我们提出了一个疑问：
房车度假为什么会这么火？
Earlier on, we were asking
why is caravanning so popular.

919
00:41:42,920 --> 00:41:46,320
为了弄个明白，
我们仨亲自去体验了一趟
房车自驾游。
To find out,
the three of us went
on a caravan holiday.

920
00:41:46,360 --> 00:41:48,240
是啊，而且
整个过程简直是一场灾难。
Yeah, and it
wasn't going well.

921
00:41:48,280 --> 00:41:50,800
-不，我们堵了几百万人。
-确实。
-No, we held up
several million people.
-Yeah.

922
00:41:50,840 --> 00:41:52,800
-Top Gear狗还吐了。
-没错。
-Top Gear Dog had been sick.
-Yeah.

923
00:41:52,840 --> 00:41:55,240
-而且他居然还把房车给撞了。
-是的。
-And he'd actually
crashed the caravan.
-Yeah.

924
00:41:55,280 --> 00:41:59,480
没错，老实讲，
我们几个当时都开始
闹翻了。
Yes, and to be honest,
we were all starting to
fall out quite badly.

925
00:41:59,520 --> 00:42:01,600
所以，我们接着看录像。
So, let's rejoin the action.

926
00:42:04,920 --> 00:42:06,440
克拉克森：
我们当时已经到了多塞特郡，
CLARKSON:
We were now in Dorset

927
00:42:06,480 --> 00:42:08,000
距离露营地
只有几英里，
just a few miles
from the site

928
00:42:08,040 --> 00:42:10,760
而且又开回了
单车道公路上，
and back on
single carriageways,

929
00:42:10,800 --> 00:42:12,920
这意味着我们屁股后面
又是老样子了。
which meant it was business
as usual behind us.

930
00:42:14,880 --> 00:42:18,440
刚出环岛的时候，
我看到了后面排的长队。
I've just seen the queue
