-All right.

962
00:43:42,360 --> 00:43:45,080
不，我是纯爷们儿，敢作敢当，
是我搞错了。
No. I'm man enough to admit
my mistake, I was wrong.

963
00:43:45,120 --> 00:43:50,040
找个农场小铁门，
我一把倒进去，
就能直接调过头来。
Spot a little farm gate
and I'll reverse it in
and flip it round.

964
